OL,3,GNEWSALives 'put at risk' after dog
OL,4,Acauses cow stampede
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople's lives were "put at risk" after
OL,7,Fa dog "chased and harassed" a herd of
OL,8,Fcattle resulting in a stampede,
OL,9,Faccording to the police.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said a loose husky
OL,12,Fallegedly ran after cows for an
OL,13,F"extended period" at Sudbury Water
OL,14,FMeadows at about 11:40 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FLivestock worrying is a criminal
OL,17,Foffence and the force appealed for
OL,18,Fanyone with information to contact it.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
