OL,3,GNEWSALives 'put at risk' after dog
OL,4,Acauses cow stampede
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A herd of cattle were chased and
OL,7,Fharassed for an extended period by a
OL,8,Floose husky type dog, causing them to
OL,9,Fstampede, putting members of the public
OL,10,Fat risk," a spokesperson said.
